## Disclaimer of Liability

This library is provided for internal infrastructure automation purposes within
BY-SYSTEMS environments. It interacts directly with Synology DSM APIs and may
perform destructive operations (user deletion, share deletion, NFS rule changes)
on Synology NAS devices.

The authors and contributors accept no liability for:
- Data loss resulting from incorrect API usage
- Service disruption caused by misconfigured automation
- Security incidents resulting from improper credential management
- Any damage to Synology hardware or software

Users are responsible for:
- Understanding the DSM operations triggered by this library
- Validating all operations in a non-production environment first
- Securing credentials and API tokens appropriately
- Reviewing and testing integration tests before running against production NAS

Use in production environments is at the operator's own risk.
